  "test_method": "Original German game executed in two mGBA cores with authored parties, maps and/or quest prerequisites. The Bill transformation is a fixture; Bill ticket dialogue is original. The network scenario uses an authored invocation of the original native special. Some combat encounters are authored. The acceptance cases are not production-launcher gameplay.",
  "limitations": [
    "Only the exact supported German original and opt-in worker are covered; original ROM bytes are not edited.",
    "Six native working slots remain. If both leads plus living EXP Share holders exceed capacity the experimental worker stops before party conversion and retains the last validated disk saves; unsaved progress since the last save is not guaranteed.",
    "Temporary pinned references can still block a reserve switch and roll back a battle.",
    "Special item effects such as Enigma Berry and all twelve-Pokemon level-up and evolution paths are not fully implemented or verified.",
    "No continuous two-player natural campaign/postgame, physical controllers, audible audio or native Windows/Bazzite acceptance.",
